  "text_md": "# (12) United States Patent Uchiyama et al.\n\n![](<304c1d231ac659ef6d0347a019cd838c2d725e2fad3a5b5f6dd76c578cb102ed_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\nUS006503413B2\n\nUS 6,503,413 B2\n\n(10) Patent No.:\n\nJan.7,2003\n\n(45) Date of Patent:\n\n# (54) STABLE, AQUEOUS COMPOSITIONS FOR TREATING SURFACES, ESPECIALLY FABRICS\n\nHirotaka Uchiyama, Symmes Twp, OH (US); Janese Christine O'Brien Stickney, Wyoming, OH (US); Jonathan Robert Cetti, Fairfield, OH (US); Ricky Ah-Man Woo, Hamilton, OH (US); Dean Larry DuVal, Lebanon, OH (US); Gayle Marie Frankenbach, Cincinnati, OH (US)\n\n(75) Inventors:\n\nThe Procter & Gamble Company, Cincinnati, OH (US)\n\n(73) Assignee:\n\nNotice:\n\nSubject to any disclaimer, the term of this patent is extended or adjusted under 35 U.S.C. 154(b) by O days.\n\n(21) Appl. No.:\n\n09/783,509\n\nFeb. 14,2001\n\n(22) Filed:\n\n(65) Prior Publication Data\n\nUS 2002/0011584 Al Jan. 31, 2002\n\n# Related U.S. Application Data\n\nContinuation-in-part of application No. 09/634,379 filed on 9, 2000. Aug;\n\nProvisional application No: 60/240,626, filed on Oct. 16, 200O, and provisional application No. 60/182,381, filed on Feb. 2000. 14,\n\nInt. CI.\n\nD06M 15/643\n\n.................... 252/8.91; 252/8.61; 424/76.1; 424/76.2\n\nField of Search 252/8.61, 8 424/76.1, 76.2 91;\n\n# (56) References Cited\n\n# U.S. PATENT DOCUMENTS\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>3,299,112</th>\n    <th>1/1967 12/1967 Bailey Bailey</th>\n    <th> </th>\n    <th>516/199</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>3,359,212</td>\n    <td>12/1967   Bailey</td>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>3,526,651</td>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td>9/1970   Rossmy et al.</td>\n    <td>556/446</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>4,005,024</td>\n    <td>1/1977</td>\n    <td>Rodriguez et al.</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>4,661,268</td>\n    <td>4/1987</td>\n    <td>Jacobson et al.</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>5,482,703</td>\n    <td>1/1996</td>\n    